<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-COMBINED SKIER ZAHARENKO BREAKS LEG.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-COMBINED SKIER ZAHARENKO BREAKS LEG.</headline>
<dateline>HOLMENKOLLEN, Norway 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sergei Zaharenko of Belarus broke a leg in a fall during the World Cup Nordic combined ski-jumping event on Friday.</p>
<p>Organisers said Zaharenko fell after jumping about 105 metres. After treatment in the emergency room he was transferred to hospital in Oslo.</p>
